# Story page: nm-thunder
# {name} becomes the snake's name. Paragraphs are separated by a blank line.
title = Nightmare: Supercell
---
The storm stopped warning anyone about anything.

Lightning struck where {name} was, and where {name} had been, and once, I swear, where {name} was merely thinking of going.

'Even the sky has a temper,' said the coil. 'Yours is smaller. Use it.' I have never understood that sentence, and I have read it many times.
